---
// Projects section component with latest iPadOS 26 Apple UI Kit design
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 lg:px-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-24">
      <h2 class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-10 tracking-tight">
        Selected Projects
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-3xl text-slate-600 max-w-5xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Real results from real clients. Here are some of the projects where I've made a significant impact on customer experience and support operations.
      </p>
      <div class="w-40 h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500/60 via-indigo-500/60 to-blue-600/60 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project layout -->
    <div class="space-y-20">
      <!-- TeachPoint Project -->
      <div class="group bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-16 md:p-20 overflow-hidden relative border border-white/30 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:bg-white/50 transition-all duration-700">
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-8">
                <span class="px-6 py-3 text-[var(--color-executive)] text-lg font-bold rounded-3xl shadow-lg" style="background-color: var(--color-primary);">SaaS Business</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 text-white text-lg font-bold rounded-3xl shadow-lg">40% Reduction</span>
              </div>
              
              <h3 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">
                <a href="https://www.goteachpoint.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors duration-300">
                  TeachPoint SaaS Support Scaling
                </a>
              </h3>
              
              <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-slate-700 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-light">
                Built a support system from scratch for an educational SaaS platform. Integrated Zendesk, trained the team, and built a comprehensive Help Center that reduced tickets by 40% in just 6 months.
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
                <div class="text-center p-8 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                  <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-3">40%</div>
                  <div class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-semibold">Ticket Reduction</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-8 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                  <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-primary)] mb-3">6</div>
                  <div class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-semibold">Months</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-10">
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-[var(--color-primary)] text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Zendesk Integration</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-[var(--color-primary)] text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Team Training</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-[var(--color-primary)] text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Help Center</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-[var(--color-primary)] text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Process Design</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
              <div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Key Achievements</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-5">
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Reduced average response time from 24 hours to 4 hours</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Built comprehensive knowledge base with 200+ articles</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Trained 15 support agents on new systems and processes</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Apple Project -->
      <div class="group bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-16 md:p-20 overflow-hidden relative border border-white/30 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:bg-white/50 transition-all duration-700">
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-5 mb-8">
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-600 text-white text-lg font-bold rounded-3xl shadow-lg">Enterprise</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 text-white text-lg font-bold rounded-3xl shadow-lg">90+ NPS</span>
              </div>
              
              <h3 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">
                <a href="https://www.apple.com/retail/cambridgeside/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-slate-600 transition-colors duration-300">
                  Apple: 3000+ Technical Support Sessions
                </a>
              </h3>
              
              <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-slate-700 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-light">
                Resolved high-volume support requests at Apple's flagship retail store with an NPS score of 90+. Provided hardware repairs, software walkthroughs, and technical guidance on iOS and macOS systems.
              </p>
              
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
                <div class="text-center p-8 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                  <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-600 mb-3">90+</div>
                  <div class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-semibold">NPS Score</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-8 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                  <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-600 mb-3">3000+</div>
                  <div class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-semibold">Sessions</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-10">
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-600 text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Hardware Support</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-600 text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Software Training</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-600 text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">iOS/macOS</span>
                <span class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-600 text-lg font-semibold rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-white/30">Customer Success</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="lg:w-1/2">
              <div class="bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-xl border border-white/30">
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Key Achievements</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-5">
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Maintained 90+ NPS score across 3000+ support sessions</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Specialized in iOS and macOS technical support</span>
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mt-3 mr-5 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <span class="text-lg text-slate-700 font-medium">Provided hardware repairs and software troubleshooting</span>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Resume CTA with liquid glass -->
    <div class="text-center mt-32">
      <div class="bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-20 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/30">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 tracking-tight">Want to See More?</h3>
          <p class="text-xl lg:text-2xl text-slate-700 mb-12 font-light max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            Download my full résumé to see all my experience and qualifications.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://www.dropbox.com/s/mj38zbpwg8its6v/yahor_resume.pdf?dl=0" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block px-16 py-6 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl text-slate-800 font-bold rounded-3xl hover:bg-white/70 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl border border-white/30 transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-lg hover:scale-105"
          >
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 inline mr-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            View Full Résumé
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
